{"number":101,"nameArabic":"سُورَةُ القَارِعَةِ","nameEnglish":"Al-Qaari'a","nameBengali":"আল-কারিয়া","englishMeaning":"The Calamity","revelationType":"Meccan","ayahCount":11,"ayahs":[{"numberInSurah":1,"arabic":"بِسْمِ ٱللَّهِ ٱلرَّحْمَٰنِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"The Striking Calamity -","bengali":"করাঘাতকারী,"},{"numberInSurah":2,"arabic":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"What is the Striking Calamity?","bengali":"করাঘাতকারী কি?"},{"numberInSurah":3,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","english":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?","bengali":"করাঘাতকারী সম্পর্কে আপনি কি জানেন ?"},{"numberInSurah":4,"arabic":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","english":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,","bengali":"যেদিন মানুষ হবে বিক্ষিপ্ত পতংগের মত"},{"numberInSurah":5,"arabic":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","english":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up.","bengali":"এবং পর্বতমালা হবে ধুনিত রঙ্গীন পশমের মত।"},{"numberInSurah":6,"arabic":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","english":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","bengali":"অতএব যার পাল্লা ভারী হবে,"},{"numberInSurah":7,"arabic":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","english":"He will be in a pleasant life.","bengali":"সে সুখীজীবন যাপন করবে।"},{"numberInSurah":8,"arabic":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","english":"But as for one whose scales are light,","bengali":"আর যার পাল্লা হালকা হবে,"},{"numberInSurah":9,"arabic":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","english":"His refuge will be an abyss.","bengali":"তার ঠিকানা হবে হাবিয়া।"},{"numberInSurah":10,"arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","english":"And what can make you know what that is?","bengali":"আপনি জানেন তা কি?"},{"numberInSurah":11,"arabic":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","english":"It is a Fire, intensely hot.","bengali":"প্রজ্জ্বলিত অগ্নি!"}]}